                [
                    70.0,
                    270.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                243,
                1053,
                296
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    253.0,
                    243.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    243.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    296.0
                ],
                [
                    253.0,
                    296.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Per ITU-T X.509 and IETF RFC 5280 (as updated by IETF RFC 6818, IETF RFC 8398 and IETF RFC 8399), \"TbsCertificate\" field will always contain sub-fields \"Version\", \"SerialNumber\", \"Signature\", \"Issuer\", \"Validity\", \"Subject\" and \"SubjectPublicKeyInfo\". If any of these fields are not present in the certificate or if the relying party/validating entity is unable to process any of these sub-fields, the relying party will reject the certificate.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                318,
                1053,
                450
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    68.0,
                    318.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    318.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    450.0
                ],
                [
                    68.0,
                    450.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "As such, these parameters (\"Version\", \"SerialNumber\", \"Signature\", \"Issuer\", \"Validity\", \"Subject\" and \"SubjectPublicKeyInfo\") are not marked as mandatory or critical in the certificate profiles below.",
            "block_bbox": [
                67,
                471,
                1053,
                526
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    67.0,
                    471.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    471.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    526.0
                ],
                [
                    67.0,
                    526.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2695] The relying party shall reject a certificate that does not contain either \"Version\", \"SerialNumber\", \"Signature\", \"Issuer\", \"Validity\", \"Subject\" or \"SubjectPublicKeyInfo\" in \"TbsCertificate\" field.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                546,
                1052,
                624
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    546.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    546.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    624.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    624.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2696] Each relying party shall be capable of interpreting/processing \"AuthorityKeyIdentifier\", \"SubjectKeyIdentifier\", \"ExtendedKeyUsage\", \"CRLDistributionPoints\", \"AuthorityInfoAccess\" and \"SubjectInfoAccess\" extensions.",
            "block_bbox": [
                70,
                647,
                1053,
                728
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    70.0,
                    647.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    647.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    728.0
                ],
                [
                    70.0,
                    728.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This document does not require relying party to be capable of interpreting/processing CertificatePolicies extension. It is left to the local policy of the relying party whether it needs to process the CertificatePolicies extension.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                749,
                1054,
                830
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
