            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1852]\n\nkeyIdentifier in \"SubjectKeyIdentifier\" shall be calculated as IETF RFC 5280:2008, 4.2.1.2, method 2 using the public key of its own certificate and shall be included as OCTET STRING in the certificate.",
