            "block_content": "[V2G20-1224] The distinguished name shall be represented as a string that complies with IETF RFC 4514, Clause 3. Per IETF RFC 5280 (as updated by IETF RFC 6818, IETF RFC 8398 and IETF RFC 8399), any certificate policy shall be valid for entire",
